# Mutation plan for the 2026-09-13 licensed demote, the ABAC gate on getUsers, and the content-flagging
# rung — the licensed halves of D-511 and D-154, measured against the licensed pair and its guest
# variant (`common::licensed`, `common::licensed_guest`).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/licensed-demote.plan
#
# The decisions a reader gets wrong: the direction of each of the six demote gates, which rung of the
# ladder each licence test reads, that demotion *replaces* the role string and clears SchemeAdmin, that
# sessions are re-rolled, and that the two not_in_* arms differ in what the ABAC flag means. The last
# two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.
